{"unit_id":"huhuai-ni__dsh-homeassistant#card-zh","repo":"huhuai-ni/dsh-homeassistant","commit":"9dab18b97df2eff82ff2a473b9ac7f305c0a4e4b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-homeassistant 是一款面向 DSH Web 客户端的智能家居插件，通过 Home Assistant REST API 把对话工具和家庭设备连接起来。它在 DSH 注册设备查询、状态查看、开关控制、灯光调节和通用服务调用工具，并在设置页提供地址与令牌配置、设备列表、分类筛选、开关操作和亮度滑条。用户可用设备别名或实体名称控制灯、开关、风扇、空调、窗帘等 Home Assistant 实体，也可查看状态或一次关闭某类设备。适合已在运行 Home Assistant、希望从 DSH 对话或设置界面管理家中设备的用户；需要配置 HA 地址和长期访问令牌。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:129-283","client.js:55-194"]}
{"unit_id":"huhuai-ni__dsh-homeassistant#card-en","repo":"huhuai-ni/dsh-homeassistant","commit":"9dab18b97df2eff82ff2a473b9ac7f305c0a4e4b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-homeassistant lets DSH web users control Home Assistant devices. Its chat tools list entities, check states, switch devices, adjust lights, and call services. A settings panel stores the HA URL and token and lists devices. Users need a running Home Assistant instance and long-lived token.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:129-283","client.js:55-194"]}
